    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\"><style>[data-colorid=oyywog4b8v]{color:#333333} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=oyywog4b8v]{color:#cccccc}[data-colorid=wnvouh97yo]{color:#333333} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=wnvouh97yo]{color:#cccccc}[data-colorid=e7rp8ck8vl]{color:#333333} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=e7rp8ck8vl]{color:#cccccc}</style>\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"MigratePrograms-Context\">Context</h2><p>Patients can be enrolled in Bahmni into programs and subsequently tracked and monitored under that program. Similar to the process of&nbsp; importing patients and encounter data into the Bahmni via CSV files ,&nbsp;<span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span data-colorid=\"oyywog4b8v\">one can also</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14.0px;\">&nbsp;enrol a large no.of patients into programs using the Programs CSV import feature.&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-warning conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"6dc121f4-bcdc-4b3e-8b26-453e7415d894\" data-macro-name=\"warning\"><p class=\"title\">Not Supported</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-error confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Programs CSV import is only for supporting enrolments of patients into Programs. Bahmni currently does not support the upload of patient encounter data in the program context through CSV files.&nbsp;</p></div></div><h2 id=\"MigratePrograms-Steps\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Steps</span></h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span data-colorid=\"wnvouh97yo\">Please refer to the sample import file :&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/wiki/download/attachments/53313567/programs.csv?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1523626332245&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-linked-resource-id=\"616398858\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"programs.csv\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"text/csv\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"53313567\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\">programs.csv</a>.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span data-colorid=\"e7rp8ck8vl\">Follow the steps as mentioned <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/53313590/Import+Data\" rel=\"nofollow\">here</a> to perform the import.&nbsp;</span></span></p><h2 id=\"MigratePrograms-KeyFields\">Key Fields&nbsp;</h2><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col /><col /><col /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Key</th><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Use</th><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Mandatory</th></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><strong>Registration Number*</strong></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">&nbsp;The identifier for the patient, for example GAN200189</td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">&nbsp;Y</td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><strong>Patient.Name</strong></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><br /></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">&nbsp;N</td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><strong>Patient.AGE</strong></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><br /></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">&nbsp;N</td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><strong>Patient.Gender</strong></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><br /></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">N</td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><strong>Patient.Village</strong></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><br /></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">N</td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><strong>Program*</strong></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">Concept name of the Program - TB, HIV</td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">Y</td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><strong>EnrollmentDate*</strong></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">Name of the visit type, for example LAB_VISIT.</td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">Y</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>After the successful import of the CSV file, an entry will be made for each patient enrolment in the &quot;patient_program&quot; table in the openMRS DB.&nbsp;</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"f7f1ff82-80b4-47d9-8f97-1a5e88e6dcc7\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: white;\"><b>On this Page</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-cssliststyle=\"none\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"7f2e67dd-8b9b-4e98-afd4-91190f6c90ab\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"9fabefcc-24c5-443d-b576-caa36908b8b3\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: white;\"><b>Other Types of Data Migration</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"a5fc861b-14ee-4fb9-bb1d-dc584d267041\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/13697066/Migrate+Patient+and+Encounter+Data\" data-linked-resource-id=\"13697066\" data-linked-resource-version=\"48\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Migrate Patient and Encounter Data</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3017015299/Migrate+Concept+Reference+Terms\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3017015299\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Migrate Concept Reference Terms</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/53313567/Migrate+Programs\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53313567\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Migrate Programs</a></li></ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/53313592/Data+Migration+-+Import\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53313592\" data-linked-resource-version=\"11\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure CSV Import - Feature Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"85d3500b-789e-4df7-b3d9-ff24954802f7\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Usage Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/53313590/Import+Data\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53313590\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure CSV Import - Implementer's Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div><p><br /></p><p><br /></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
